<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	   27/23 D     April	  28/25 D</p>
<p> May	     30/23 D     May	    25/22 D</p>
<p> July	     10/5 D     July	     7/5 D</p>
